# Line-ending policy. Mirrors TheCue/.gitattributes — added 2026-08-27 after
# `git status` reported index.html, privacy.html and terms.html as modified when
# nothing in them had changed. All four files had been rewritten CRLF in the
# working tree while Git stored them as LF, so every line diffed.
#
# That matters more here than it looks: this repo is the published legal site, and
# a `git diff` full of phantom changes is exactly what hides a real edit to a
# privacy policy or terms page.

# Normalize all text to LF in the repository; Git picks the right ending on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never transform, never diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
